    "starRating": "THREE",
    "comment": "Una pachorra total para atender. Tienen dos vias para la carga una en cada sentido de circulación y como no respetan el orden de llegada mientras de un lado se hace una cola interminable del otro entra alguien y lo atienden al instante. Al shop le falta mucho para ser una estación que está sobre una ruta. No hay para comer mas que galletita, golosinas o facturas\n\n(Translated by Google)\nThe service is incredibly slow. They have two charging lanes, one in each direction, and since they don\u0027t respect the order of arrival, while an endless queue forms on one side, someone else walks in on the other and is served instantly. The shop is far from what you\u0027d expect from a service station on a highway. There\u0027s nothing to eat but cookies, candy, or pastries.",
